<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50402" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰλύς</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ύος</span>, ἡ</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mud, slime</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεύχεα . . κείσεθ᾽ ὑπ᾽ ἰλύος
					κεκαλυμμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.318
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.94.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
				354.19
			</span></i>, etc.; of alluvial soil, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. καὶ ψάμμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dregs, sediment</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.66
			</span></i>; of wine, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				753a24
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>impurity</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἵματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					1.603
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				616
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέρνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Androm.
				</span></i>
			 ap. eund.<i><span class="en">
				14.35
			</span></i>. [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰλῡς -ῡν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Choerob.
					<u>in Theod.</u>
					1.331
				</span></i>
			; gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰλῠος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					4.230
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.10
			</span></i>, but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰλῡος</span> (metri gr.
				Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.117
			</span></i>) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i> l.c.] (Cf. Russ. <i>il</i>, Polish <i>it</i> 'mud',
			'potter's clay'.)</div>
